# Single source of truth for pinned build/codegen tool versions.
#
# Consumers:
#   - .devcontainer/Dockerfile: the `just dev-image` target (see justfile)
#     reads this file and passes every entry through as `docker build
#     --build-arg KEY=VALUE`. The Dockerfile's ARGs have NO defaults on
#     purpose (see the Dockerfile's guard RUN) — a default would recreate a
#     second source of truth that could silently disagree with this file.
#   - .github/workflows/release-completer.yml: runs in goreleaser-cross, not
#     the devcontainer image, so it cannot just inherit these — it loads this
#     same file into $GITHUB_ENV and installs buf/protoc-gen-go/
#     protoc-gen-go-grpc/versionator at the versions named here.
#   - .github/workflows/ci.yml: the build-container job builds
#     .devcontainer/Dockerfile directly via docker/build-push-action (not
#     `just dev-image`), so it loads this file into a step output and passes
#     it as that action's `build-args` input. It does that through
#     `just tool-version-args` (build/ci.justfile), which is also what
#     release-completer.yml's `just release-install-tools` sources.
#   - .github/actions/setup-just: every workflow step is a `just` target, so
#     runners outside the devcontainer image have to install `just` before
#     they can run one. It reads JUST_VERSION here so a runner and the image
#     can never disagree about which `just` is running the CI contract.
#
# internal/buildpins' drift-gate test (TestToolVersionPins) parses this file
# plus the Dockerfile and both workflows and fails if any of them disagree,
# or if a consumer stops deriving from this file altogether.
#
# Format: plain KEY=value, one per line, `#` comment lines and blank lines
# allowed — every consumer filters those out with `grep -v '^#' | grep -v
# '^$'` before treating the rest as KEY=VALUE pairs (so the same one-liner
# works whether the target is a GitHub Actions env file, a build-arg list, or
# a shell `source`). Do not add quoting or export statements; keep it boring.

GO_VERSION=1.25.10
UPX_VERSION=4.2.4
ONNX_VERSION=1.20.1
GOLANGCI_LINT_VERSION=2.12.1
BUF_VERSION=1.47.2
PROTOC_GEN_GO_VERSION=1.36.11
PROTOC_GEN_GO_GRPC_VERSION=1.6.2
GREMLINS_VERSION=0.6.0
VERSIONATOR_VERSION=0.2.1
GORELEASER_VERSION=2.16.0
LIZARD_VERSION=1.22.2
JUST_VERSION=1.40.0
GOPLS_VERSION=0.21.0
